WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:00,920
what

2
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:02,900
She actually gave birth to her child

3
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:04,780
As long as you are not married

4
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,420
I'll have the chance to be a child, right?

5
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:08,070
lucky

6
00:00:08,430 --> 00:00:10,870
You said you should set fire to her and save her?

7
00:00:11,110 --> 00:00:12,270
Such a pretty face

8
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:15,470
If I take another look, there will still be you, Miss Lin.

9
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:32,710
She is my baby, you finish ladudu

10
00:00:32,830 --> 00:00:34,830
I can’t eat it yet. I’ll go back to my new home right away.

11
00:00:34,950 --> 00:00:37,590
Mom has prepared delicious food for us to drink and stop crying when we are ready.

12
00:00:37,830 --> 00:00:40,350
Baby Chachacha

13
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:50,250
The baby has no mouth, sister

14
00:00:50,370 --> 00:00:54,860
Baby, take a bite. Sorry to interrupt the meal.
